Suggests: postgresql, certbot
Description: sync server and web interface for the ActivityTrack app
 ActivityTrack Web keeps the data of the ActivityTrack Android app of an
 organisation's users: activities, to-dos, master data and attachments sync
 both ways with the phones, which pair by scanning a QR code. In the browser
 users work as on the phone, managers see their team, company readers the
 reports of their companies, and administrators manage users, phones and the
 policy the phones apply.
 .
 It runs on gunicorn behind nginx or Apache, with SQLite or PostgreSQL.
